      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This appears to still be the case. At least it was for me. I can get normal int64 / long to work fine though. It also works for unsigned 32-bit integers. It seems to only be unsigned 64-bit (ulong) that fails.\nI also see that same log message when encountering the issue.\nThis is on the current Udon SDK release, with the current non-beta client.\nSDK used: VRCSDK3-WORLD-2020.08.07.18.18_Public.unitypackage",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
